# @miden-sdk/miden-sdk lives on the private Gitea npm registry (published by
# leviathan-client/crates/web-client/publish-node.sh). The version is PINNED
# to the exact build the Leviathan wallet extension itself bundles
# (0.15.0-node.5e72c326) — client note-building must match the wallet's SDK.
# GITEA_NPM_TOKEN may be empty when the registry allows anonymous read.
@miden-sdk:registry=https://git.softly.com/api/packages/leviathan/npm/
//git.softly.com/api/packages/leviathan/npm/:_authToken=${GITEA_NPM_TOKEN}
